Third-party components
----------------------
This repository does not vendor (redistribute) any third-party source code,
fonts, models, or media. Runtime and build-time dependencies are installed via
npm, and some assets (web fonts, the MediaPipe WASM runtime, and the pose model)
are fetched from third-party CDNs at run time. Their licenses and any required
attributions are summarized in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

